per bound approaches threshold. Together with the overall +0.141 estimate, this is best interpreted as a subthreshold association not established enough to accept. H75, H80, and the original H42 are rejected and closed. The broad screens H85 and H86 are null and closed. All statements remain associations in this supplied dataset. Conditional persistence across measured binary strata reduces the plausibility of simple confounding among feature_037, feature_002, and feature_010, but it does not establish causality, biological mechanism, or generalizability, and latent correlated structure cannot be ruled out.",
