pper feature_040 half after excluding feature_002 and feature_010, and tested feature_063 in the upper feature_040 half after excluding feature_010 and feature_037. These comparisons distinguish broad main-effect associations from apparent effects induced by overlapping positive markers or by feature_040 strata. Expected directions are: feature_063 lower outcome_001; feature_002, feature_010, and feature_037-associated effects according to the accepted directions feature_002/feature_010 higher and feature_037 lower. Plausible alternatives include null conditional effects, attenuation by feature_040, residual confounding by other predictors, or sign reversals, especially where cells are smaller. All conclusions remain observational and dataset-specific; causal interpretation and generalizability are not claimed.",
