bust overall and validation evidence elsewhere. Voluntary validation capacity is exhausted, so I deferred the unresolved and previously borderline feature_063 contexts and closed rejected comparisons. The broader audit concern remains substantial post-selection multiplicity, overlapping conditional strata, collinearity among feature_037, feature_002, feature_010, and feature_063, small cell sizes in quartile exclusions, and the observational Welch-contrast design; none of these findings can be interpreted as causal or generally transportable.",
